    "final_answer": "I have all the information I need. Let me provide the final answer.\n\n## Final Answer\n\n### Most Downloaded English-Chinese (en-zh) Machine Translation Model\n\n**Model**: **Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh**\n\nAfter filtering Hugging Face's translation models by language pair (en-zh) and sorting by downloads, **Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh** is identified as the most downloaded model specifically designed for English→Chinese translation.\n\n**Note on candidates considered:**\n- `facebook/nllb-200-distilled-600M` (854k downloads) - multilingual model, not specifically en-zh\n- `Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-zh-en` (178k downloads) - zh→en direction only\n- **`Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh` (98,564 downloads last month)** - specifically en→zh ✓\n\n### Model Overview\n| Attribute | Value |\n|-----------|-------|\n| **Repository** | Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh |\n| **Languages** | eng-zho (English → Chinese) |\n| **Model Type** | Transformer (MarianMT) |\n| **License** | Apache-2.0 |\n| **Downloads/month** | 98,564 |\n| **Likes** | 406 |\n| **Original Repo** | Tatoeba-Challenge |\n| **Training Date** | 2020-07-17 |\n| **Released** | 2020-08-21 |\n| **Pre-processing** | Normalization + SentencePiece (spm32k) |\n\n### Latest Performance Metrics\n| Test Set | BLEU | chr-F |\n|----------|------|-------|\n| Tatoeba-test.eng.zho | **31.4** | **0.268** |\n\nAdditional metrics: `brevity_penalty = 0.8959`, `ref_len = 110,468.0`\n\n### Usage Guidelines\n\n**1. Sentence Initial Language Token Required** — Input text must be prefixed with a language token in the format `>>id<<` (specifically `>>zho<<` for the target language).\n\n**2. Quick Python Example (using Hugging Face Hub):**\n```python\nimport os\nfrom huggingface_hub import InferenceClient\n\nclient = InferenceClient(\n    provider=\"hf-inference\",\n    api_key=os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"],\n)\n\nresult = client.translation(\n    \"Your English text here\",\n    model=\"Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh\",\n)\n```\n\n**3. Direct Use via Web UI** — The model can also be tested directly on Hugging Face's hosted Inference API widget on the model page.\n\n**4. Transformers Library Usage** — Standard MarianMT loading pattern works with the `transformers` library (`AutoTokenizer` + `AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM`).\n\n**5. Target Language Variants** — The model handles multiple Chinese script variants: `cjy_Hans`, `cjy_Hant`, `cmn`, `cmn_Hans`, `cmn_Hant`, `gan`, `lzh`, `lzh_Hans`, `nan`, `wuu`, `yue`, `yue_Hans`, `yue_Hant`.",
